  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 405.01 Competence to Practice. All licensees shall, through education and experience, maintain the ability to practice nursing or nursing related activities competently.\n\nSource. #9096, eff 2-23-08; ss by #10299, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10571, eff 4-17-14; renumbered by #10953 (from Nur 404.12); ss by #11082, eff 4-26-16 (formerly Nur 404.13)",
